    <sys:String x:Key="Str_Game_BoostTip">When off, the app never touches this game (priority, cores, EcoQoS). Turn it off if a tool like Process Lasso manages it. Takes effect the next time the game starts.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str_Game_AutoPurgeLabel">Auto purge while it runs</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str_Game_AutoPurgeTip">When off, automatic purges pause while this game runs. The purge button and the hotkey still work.</sys:String>

