    <sys:String x:Key="Str_Settings_TimerIdleOffDesc">Lets the PC sleep; back on when you return</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str_Settings_TimerIdleOffTip">While the timer is on, Windows does not go to sleep by itself. With this on, no mouse or keyboard input for the chosen time turns the timer off (the PC can sleep again), and your next input turns it back on. Never while a Game Mode game runs: gamepad input does not count.</sys:String>
